OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 300 artworks on display
OL,4,Aat free exhibit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA free exhibition has returned to Hull
OL,7,Fwith more than 300 pieces of art on
OL,8,Fdisplay.
OL,10,FThe artworks for the Open Exhibition at
OL,11,FFerens Art Gallery were chosen by a
OL,12,Fpanel of judges and include art made by
OL,13,Fboth amateur and professional artists.
OL,15,FKerri Offord, Curator of Art at Ferens
OL,16,FArt Gallery, said: "There is such an
OL,17,Fexciting range of 2D and sculptural
OL,18,Fworks on display in the exhibition. We
OL,19,Fhope our visitors are inspired to be
OL,20,Fcreative after their visit."
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
