OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 300 artworks on display
OL,4,Aat free exhibit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe event began on Friday and will run
OL,7,Funtil 10 January 2027 alongside the
OL,8,FYoung Artist Open Exhibition,
OL,9,Fshowcasing work from artists aged 15
OL,10,Fand under.
